}

### 8.32 R10: large room, 2 hours and 1 minute (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{largeRoomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "eva-{{roomId}}",
  "startUtc": "2030-03-10T12:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-03-10T14:01:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 8.33 R10: large room, 4 hours is fine for R6 but not for R10 (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{largeRoomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "eva-{{roomId}}",
  "startUtc": "2030-03-10T12:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-03-10T16:00:00Z",
